CreateMarket_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the admin
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the admin
    ├── when the market id is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the market id is not zero
        ├── given the market already exists
        │   └── it should revert
        └── given the market does not exist yet
            ├── when the price exponent is outside minus 18 to 0
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the price exponent is minus 18 to 0
                ├── when the settings switch the market on
                │   └── it should revert
                └── when the settings leave the market off
                    ├── when the settings are invalid
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── when the settings are valid
                        ├── given 65535 markets already exist
                        │   └── it should revert
                        └── given fewer than 65535 markets exist
                            ├── it should store the market, switched off and unpaused
                            ├── it should give it the next index
                            └── it should emit {MarketCreated}, then {ConfigUpdated}
